ame":"ability_melee_magician","description":"","abilityType":"melee"},{"id":"3156905386","name":"Vexing Bolt","nameRu":"Досаждающий заряд","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/magician/magician_magicbolt.png","className":"ability_magician_magicbolt","description":"Fire a bolt of magic that deals <Panel class=\"AbilityPropertyIcon prop_tech_damage\"> <span class=\"highlight_spirit\">Damage</span>, <span class=\"highlight\">increasing as it travels</span>. If you have an <span class=\"highlight\">Assistant</span>, they also cast Vexing Bolt at reduced damage. <br><br>Press <span class=\"highlight\"> Ability 1 </span> to <span class=\"highlight\">redirect</span> the bolt towards your crosshairs.","descriptionRu":"Синклер выпускает магический заряд, <Panel class=\"AbilityPropertyIcon prop_tech_damage\"> <span class=\"highlight_spirit\">урон</span> которого <span class=\"highlight\">увеличивается со временем полёта до цели</span>. Если призван <span class=\"highlight\">помощник</span>, он тоже применяет ‭«Досаждающий заряд», но наносит меньше урона. <br><br>Нажмите <span class=\"highlight\"> 1-е умение </span>, чтобы <span class=\"highlight\">перенаправить</span> заряд в сторону вашего прицела.","abilityType":"signature"},{"id":"12456023","name":"Spectral Assistant","nameRu":"Призрачный помощник","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/magician/magician_cloneturret.png","className":"ability_magician_cloneturret","description":"Summon an <span class=\"highlight\">Assistant</span> at the targeted location. The <span class=\"highlight\">Assistant</span> attacks whenever you fire your weapon, dealing <Panel class=\"AbilityPropertyIcon prop_tech_damage\"> <span class=\"highlight_spirit\">Damage</span>. <br><br>While the <span class=\"highlight\">Assistant</span> is out, you can press <span class=\"highlight\"> Ability 2 </span> to swap positions with your <span class=\"highlight\">Assistant</span>. <br><br><span class=\"diminish\">Casting Spectral Assistant also reloads your weapon.</span>","descriptionRu":"Синклер призывает <span class=\"highlight\">помощника</span> в выбранном месте. <span class=\"highlight\">Помощник</span> атакует врагов, нанося им <Panel class=\"AbilityPropertyIcon prop_tech_damage\"> <span class=\"highlight_spirit\">урон</span>, когда вы стреляете из оружия. <br><br>Вы можете нажать <span class=\"highlight\"> 2-е умение </span>, чтобы поменяться с <span class=\"highlight\">помощником</span> местами. <br><br><span class=\"diminish\">Призыв помощника также перезаряжает ваше оружие.</span>","abilityType":"signature"},{"id":"191022746","name":"Audience Participation","nameRu":"Участие аудитории","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/magician/magician_copyult.png","className":"ability_magician_copyult","description":"<span class=\"highlight\">Copy the Ultimate</span> of an enemy hero for a limited time. Reactivating the ability will use the <span class=\"highlight\">Copied Ultimate</span> instead.<br><br><span class=\"diminish\">Copies will inherit this ability's upgrade points.<br>Audience Participation will also copy the cooldown.","descriptionRu":"Синклер временно <span class=\"highlight\">копирует ульт</span> вражеского героя. Повторное использование этого умения активирует <span class=\"highlight\">скопированный ульт</span>.<br><br><span class=\"diminish\">У скопированных ультов будут улучшения от этого умения.<br>‭«Участие аудитории» также копирует время перезарядки умения.","abilityType":"ultimate"},{"id":"2142213586","name":"Rabbit Hex","nameRu":"Кроличий сглаз","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/magician/magician_animalcurse.png","className":"ability_magician_animalhexarea","description":"Hex a target area and transform all enemies into a <span class=\"highlight\">Rabbit</span> for a limited duration.<br><br> Rabbits are small and <Panel class=\"AbilityPropertyIcon prop_move_speed\"> <span class=\"highlight\">move faster</span>, but take increased <Panel class=\"AbilityPropertyIcon prop_damage\"><span class=\"highlight\">Damage</span> and are <Panel class=\"AbilityPropertyIcon prop_cast\"><span class=\"highlight\">unable to perform most actions</span>.<br><span class=\"diminish\">Hex does not interrupt abilities.</span>","descriptionRu":"Временно превращает всех врагов в выбранной области в <span class=\"highlight\">кроликов</span>.<br><br>Кролики маленькие и <Panel class=\"AbilityPropertyIcon prop_move_speed\"> <span class=\"highlight\">двигаются быстрее</span>, но получают <Panel class=\"AbilityPropertyIcon prop_damage\"><span class=\"highlight\">больше урона</span> и <Panel class=\"AbilityPropertyIcon prop_cast\"><span class=\"highlight\">не могут выполнять большинство действий</span>.<br><span class=\"diminish\">Превращение не прерывает умения.</span>","abilityType":"signature"},{"id":"2573821048","name":"Knocked off Zipline","nameRu":"Падение с зиплайна","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_zip_line","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"1466127517","name":"Jump","nameRu":"Прыжок","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_jump","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"2335418656","name":"Slide","nameRu":"Скольжение","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_slide","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"875395762","name":"citadel_ability_zipline_boost","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/upgrades/mods_utility/zipline_mastery.png","className":"citadel_ability_zipline_boost","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"4109126631","name":"Mantle","nameRu":"Преодоление препятствия","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_mantle","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"4261702459","name":"citadel_ability_climb_rope","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_climb_rope","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"1443159618","name":"","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/hud/icons/icon_speed.svg","className":"citadel_ability_sprint","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"2207638101","name":"Dash","nameRu":"Рывок","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_dash","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"664285540","name":"Parry","nameRu":"Парирование","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_melee_parry","description":"","abilityType":"innate"}],"updatedAt":"2026-11-15T20:33:22.456Z"}}